{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 31,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Sons and Heirs Through Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now I say "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the heir, as long as he is a child, does not differ at all from a slave, though he is master of all, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but is under guardians and stewards until the time appointed by the father. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even so we, when we were children, were in bondage under the elements of the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when the fullness of the time had come, God sent forth His Son, born"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or made"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of a woman, born under the law, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to redeem those who were under the law, that we might receive the adoption as sons."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And because you are sons, God has sent forth the Spirit of His Son into your hearts, crying out, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit., in Aram., Father"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Abba, Father!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore you are no longer a slave but a son, and if a son, then an heir "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU through God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits through Christ"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "through Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Fears for the Church"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But then, indeed, when you did not know God, you served those which by nature are not gods. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But now after you have known God, or rather are known by God, how "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is it that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you turn again to the weak and beggarly elements, to which you desire again to be in bondage? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You observe days and months and seasons and years. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I am afraid for you, lest I have labored for you in vain."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, I urge you to become like me, for I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "became"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " like you. You have not injured me at all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You know that because of physical infirmity I preached the gospel to you at the first. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And my trial which was in my flesh you did not despise or reject, but you received me as an "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or messenger"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "angel of God, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "even"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as Christ Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Where"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What then was the blessing you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "enjoyed?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " For I bear you witness that, if possible, you would have plucked out your own eyes and given them to me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Have I therefore become your enemy because I tell you the truth?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They zealously court you, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "but"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for no good; yes, they want to exclude you, that you may be zealous for them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But it is good to be zealous in a good thing always, and not only when I am present with you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "My little children, for whom I labor in birth again until Christ is formed in you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I would like to be present with you now and to change my tone; for I have doubts about you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Two Covenants"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Tell me, you who desire to be under the law, do you not hear the law? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For it is written that Abraham had two sons: the one by a bondwoman, the other by a freewoman. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the bondwoman was born according to the flesh, and he of the freewoman through promise, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "which things are symbolic. For these are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the two covenants: the one from Mount Sinai which gives birth to bondage, which is Hagar— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for this Hagar is Mount Sinai in Arabia, and corresponds to Jerusalem which now is, and is in bondage with her children— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but the Jerusalem above is free, which is the mother of us all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For it is written:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Rejoice, O barren,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "You"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "who do not bear!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Break forth and shout,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "You who are not in labor!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "For the desolate has many more children"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Than she who has a husband.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now we, brethren, as Isaac "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " are children of promise. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But, as he who was born according to the flesh then persecuted him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who was born"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to the Spirit, even so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " now. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless what does the Scripture say? "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Cast out the bondwoman and her son, for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "the son of the bondwoman shall not be heir with the son of the freewoman.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So then, brethren, we are not children of the bondwoman but of the free."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}